1
00:00:03,205 --> 00:00:07,980
The Subject Flows list shows each subject with a badge for its direction,

2
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:10,761
and Missing flow until it has an action.

3
00:00:10,761 --> 00:00:15,898
Edit Settings reopens the settings, Edit Content Type opens the whole type, and

4
00:00:15,898 --> 00:00:17,893
Manage Flow opens the flow.

5
00:00:17,893 --> 00:00:20,915
Open Edit Content Type, and click Add Field.

6
00:00:21,365 --> 00:00:25,553
Give the field a name, pick its type, here a text field, and save.

7
00:00:25,553 --> 00:00:30,265
The agent fills in the fields of the subject while completing the activity.

